{"4861080":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Dice Breakers","steam_appid":4861080,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4899490],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Break dice, earn money, and build your destruction empire!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice Breakers is an incremental game where every dice you destroy brings you closer to new upgrades, automated minions, and rewards. Start by breaking dice manually and evolve into a fully automated destruction machine.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861080\/extras\/04ea2852b9b2dbabd5185ef7d74335bf.poster.avif?t=1793642574\" width=444 height=152 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861080\/extras\/04ea2852b9b2dbabd5185ef7d74335bf.webm?t=1793642574\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861080\/extras\/04ea2852b9b2dbabd5185ef7d74335bf.mp4?t=1793642574\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire minions to do the work for you. They will roll and break dice automatically.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861080\/extras\/9e02376f567787ce9a783307e189686c.poster.avif?t=1793642574\" width=576 height=232 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861080\/extras\/9e02376f567787ce9a783307e189686c.webm?t=1793642574\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861080\/extras\/9e02376f567787ce9a783307e189686c.mp4?t=1793642574\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new types of dice. Better dice give more rewards.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861080\/extras\/548eb87f640f1b8919815a37499a64f9.poster.avif?t=1793642574\" width=600 height=258 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861080\/extras\/548eb87f640f1b8919815a37499a64f9.webm?t=1793642574\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861080\/extras\/548eb87f640f1b8919815a37499a64f9.mp4?t=1793642574\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get stronger minions. Each one helps you earn more coins in different ways.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861080\/extras\/e612e921cbc43b8f1fbf2f1a60243306.poster.avif?t=1793642574\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861080\/extras\/e612e921cbc43b8f1fbf2f1a60243306.webm?t=1793642574\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861080\/extras\/e612e921cbc43b8f1fbf2f1a60243306.mp4?t=1793642574\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset your progress to get permanent upgrades. Come back stronger and go further each time.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861080\/extras\/12c0045b0677a5d14430187c0b4a0d9c.poster.avif?t=1793642574\" width=600 height=286 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861080\/extras\/12c0045b0677a5d14430187c0b4a0d9c.webm?t=1793642574\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4861080\/extras\/12c0045b0677a5d14430187c0b4a0d9c.mp4?t=1793642574\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break dice to earn rewards.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock multiple types of dice with increasing benefits.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire automated minions to boost your production.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase upgrades that transform the way you play.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige system with permanent progression.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of upgrades and levels to discover.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic-inspired pixel art graphics.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you take your dice breaking empire?<\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Break dice, earn money, and build your destruction empire!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice Breakers is an incremental game where every dice you destroy brings you closer to new upgrades, automated minions, and rewards. Start by breaking dice manually and evolve into a fully automated destruction machine.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\